\\"3 sonnet engineers and 2 haiku researchers\\\\\\\") is not a requirement and is left out by the intake skill. Pull request red-cup-engineering/computer-services-section#49 (\\\\\\\"Control a home grow autonomically and find what to grow\\\\\\\") was judged \\\\\\\"evacuate\\\\\\\" on 2026-10-09: its one household's Minnesota data and its bespoke MAPE-K loop belong in science and operations and in the Group's MAPE-K engine, not in a generic engineering repository (note on receiving the open pull requests, line 118 and 310).\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"need\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"The Group holds cited research on lawfully growing eight cannabis plants indoors in Minnesota, on what to grow, and on how an AI-assisted grow is monitored and planned.\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"requirements\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.array\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.object\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"class\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"functional\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"id\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"R1\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"moscow\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"must\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"rationale\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"The Leader names MN and eight plants; the limits decide what the engineering and operations may do.\\\"\"]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"says\\\"\"],[\"pair\",[\"mark\",\"\\\"sen.json.string\\\"\"],[\"mark\",\"\\\"The Minnesota cultivation research record shall state the legal limits on plant count, flowering plants, possession and premises that govern an eight-plant indoor household grow, each cited to the statute or rule that sets it.\\\"\"]]],[\"star\"]]]]]]],[\"pair\",[\"pair\",[\"mar