ts to chemotype classes.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"verifies\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.array\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R3\""]],["star"]]]],["star"]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.object\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"id\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"mn-grow-science:sourcing-research\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"method\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"assay\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"says\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"A Minnesota sourcing record exists.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"verifies\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.array\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R4\""]],["star"]]]],["star"]]]]]],["star"]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"context\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Leader names three layers (science, engineering, operations), so the ask is three requests in the order science, engineering, operations. The staffing sentence (\\\"3 sonnet engineers and 2 haiku researchers\\\") is not a requirement and is left out by the intake skill. Pull request red-cup-engineering/computer-services-section#49 (\\\"Control a home grow autonomically and find what to grow\\\") was judged \\\"evacuate\\\" on 2026-10-09: its one household's Minnesota data and its bespoke MAPE-K loop belong in science and operations and in the Group's MAPE-K engine, not in a generic engineering repository (note on receiving the open pull requests, line 118 and 310).\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"need\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Group holds cited research on lawfully growing eight cannabis plants indoors in Minnesota, on what to grow, and on how an AI-assisted grow is monitored and planned.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"requirements\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.array\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.object\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"class\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"functional\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"id\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R1\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"moscow\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"must\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"rationale\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Leader names MN and eight plants; the limits decide what the engineering and operations may do.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"says\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Minnesota cultivation research record shall state the legal limits on plant count, flowering plants, possession and premises that govern an eight-plant indoor household grow, each cited to the statute or rule that sets it.\""]]],["star"]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.object\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"class\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"functional\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"id\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R2\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"moscow\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"must\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"rationale\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The engineering controller needs setpoints that science, not code, owns.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"says\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The cultivation research record shall state, per growth stage, the environmental and substrate setpoint ranges for indoor cannabis cultivation, each cited to a source.\""]]],["star"]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.object\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"class\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"functional\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"id\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R3\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"moscow\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"should\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"rationale\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Group already holds a chemotype note; the new research extends it.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"says\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The cultivation research record shall relate the setpoint ranges to the chemotype classes the Group's cannabis notes define.\""]]],["star"]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.object\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"class\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"functional\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"id\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"R4\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"moscow\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"could\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"rationale\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The Leader lists \\\"finding cannabis\\\"; the phrase is read as sourcing and kept at could until the Leader confirms the reading.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"says\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"The finding-cannabis research record shall state the lawful sources in Minnesota from which a household can obtain cannabis or cultivation stock, with each source's published terms.\""]]],["star"]]]]]]],["star"]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"scope\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.array\""],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"section:services/science-services-section/services/natural-science-services-section/services/biological-science-services-section/services/botany-services-section\""]],["star"]]]],["star"]]]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"raisedBy\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"emsenn\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"section\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.string\""],["mark","\"lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/science-services-section/services/natural-science-services-section/services/biological-science-services-section/services/botany-services-section\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"serves\""],["pair",["mark","\"sen.json.array\""],["star"]]],["pair",["pair",["m